Summary: Silero VAD + LiveKit turn-detector v1-mini sidecar for the Go Gateway — docs/components/gateway/discord-voice.md's 'Resolved: Silero VAD' and 'In Progress: Turn-Taking Model'. Stateless-over-the-wire for both: the caller (Gateway) holds any per-speaker state and passes what it needs with every request; this process holds no per-connection state at all.
